  "goodToKnow": "Der Unterschlupf is a shelter, refuge or hiding place: Unterschlupf suchen, finden, jemandem Unterschlupf gewähren (to give someone shelter). It's used for people on the run, refugees and animals in winter. Unterschlüpfen means to take shelter. Synonyms: die Zuflucht, das Versteck (hiding place), die Unterkunft (accommodation). Plural (rare): die Unterschlupfe."
